  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the scrapheap beneath the Growl Bikes Garage, Scrapper learned to wrench before he could waddle. He saw his flock get wiped out going after a big DRIP score and now he rides solo. He trusts his Gasser Shadow and his clan beads for luck.",
    "class": "Mechanic Raider",
    "name": "Scrapper Starburst",
    "personality": "Gruff and independent, Scrapper trusts machines more than ducks. He's got a soft spot for hatchlings, though he'd never admit it. He can't resist tinkering with scavenged tech, often to explosive results.",
